   944	
   945	## 6. UI workup
   946	
   947	### 6.1 Placement and entry: sheet plus full page
   948	
   949	The character sheet gains a compact **Damage per round** card among derived
   950	combat facts. A complete card shows one number, the visible headline-scenario
   951	caption, and a **Full damage analysis** link. It does not show a chart, round
   952	table, editable setting, or second attack choice in the sheet's limited space.
   953	
   954	The link opens `/characters/:characterId/damage-analysis` with the normalized
   955	headline request in the query string. The full advanced page shows the same
   956	number from the same `DprSimulationResult`, then exposes all controls and the
   957	result grid. The page is also linked from the planner. Its header identifies
   958	the character and provides links back to sheet and planner.
   959	
   960	This arrangement satisfies the two distinct jobs without two implementations:
   961	the sheet answers “what is the current headline under these stated inputs?”;
   962	the page answers “what produced it, and how does it change when I edit the
   963	scenario?” The query service is the sole producer of numeric results. Renderers
   964	may format and label values but cannot derive them.
   965	
   966	### 6.2 Recommended layouts
   967	
   968	Character-sheet card:
   969	
   970	```text
   971	+------------------------------------------+
   972	| Damage per round                         |
   973	| 27.4                                     |
   974	| 3 rounds · AC 15 · normal · 2 enc · 1 SR|
   975	| Full damage analysis ->                  |
   976	+------------------------------------------+
   977	```
   978	
   979	Advanced page:
   980	
   981	```text
   982	+------------------------------------------------------------------+
   983	| <- Character sheet       Damage analysis (advanced)              |
   984	| Character name · current level                                   |
   985	+------------------------------+-----------------------------------+
   986	| SCENARIO                     | RESULT                            |
   987	| Routine [existing option v]  | 27.4 damage / round              |
   988	| Target AC [ 15 ]             | rounded to one decimal           |
   989	| Roll state [Normal v]        |                                   |
   990	| Relevant save [+2] (dynamic) | Encounter 1 · after Long Rest    |
   991	| Damage responses [...]       | Round  Action     Damage  Spend  |
   992	|                              | 1      ...         21.3    ...   |
   993	| ENCOUNTER                    | 2      ...         30.4    ...   |
   994	| Rounds [ 3 ]                 | 3      ...         30.4    ...   |
   995	| Encounters per block [ 1 ]   | Encounter 2 · after Short Rest   |
   996	| Short Rests before LR [ 1 ]  | 1      ...         18.7    ...   |
   997	| Resource policy [Budget v]   | [contributions / assumptions]    |
   998	| Total encounters: 2          |                                   |
   999	| [Calculate]                  |                                   |
  1000	+------------------------------+-----------------------------------+
  1001	```
  1002	
  1003	On narrow screens, scenario controls stack before the result. Native number
