  1007	### 6.3 Result presentation
  1008	
  1009	The complete page uses one headline plus the evidence needed to understand it:
  1010	
  1011	- average damage per round, rounded to one decimal for display;
  1012	- average encounter damage and, for a rest cycle, total cycle damage and total
  1013	  cycle rounds;
  1014	- each concrete encounter and the rest that precedes it;
  1015	- each round's expected damage, setup/action description, contributions, and
