   748	## F20 — parse boundary accepts unknown enum members in class feature effects (2026-08-14)
   749	
   750	Found while reviewing the R3 lane, and verified PRE-EXISTING on `main` — not
   751	introduced by that lane, so it did not block its merge. Executed probes against
   752	`parseSourceCatalogRecord('class', ...)` on `main`:
