The key arithmetic is now clear. At level 7, the SRD budgets are 750/1,300/1,700 XP per character, while the roster tops out at CR 2 (450 XP). That creates an important design constraint: with only 4–6 creatures, the roster cannot fill Moderate or High SRD budgets for either party size; for three characters, six CR-2 creatures are nevertheless “potentially deadly” under the Lazy benchmark. I’ll make that disagreement explicit and require simulation to arbitrate it rather than smoothing it away.
