+| 14 | 20 | 19 | 196 (147–245) | +11 | 89 | 4 | 22 (4d10) |
+| 15 | >20 | 19 | 210 (158–263) | +11 | 95 | 5 | 19 (3d10 + 3) |
+| 16 | >20 | 19 | 229 (172–286) | +11 | 101 | 5 | 21 (4d8 + 3) |
